                <note rend="inline" type="source">690d.003/20: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Beirut</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Knabenshue</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-03-22T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 22,
                                1924—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Before taking action on your telegram of March 20, 11 a.m., concerning increase
                    in customs duty on alcohol, Department desires information regarding provisions
                    of the law in question and the attitude of nationals of other countries.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
